OL,3,GNEWSAClear-up begins at biker cafe
OL,4,Adestroyed by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clean-up operation has begun at a
OL,7,Fcafe destroyed by fire, with the owner
OL,8,Fsaying it "will be back".
OL,10,FThe View Coffee Shop in Milton Abbas,
OL,11,FDorset, went up in flames in the early
OL,12,Fhours of 27 June and the neighbouring
OL,13,Fsports pavilion was also damaged.
OL,15,FHayley Bridge, who launched the cafe in
OL,16,F2023, says she must wait for the
OL,17,Finsurance process to complete before
OL,18,Fsubmitting a planning application to
OL,19,Frebuild but, seven weeks after the
OL,20,Fblaze, she has been given the go-ahead
OL,21,Fto start clearing the wreckage.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
