OL,3,GNEWSAClear-up begins at biker cafe
OL,4,Adestroyed by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Staff, family and customers are all
OL,7,Fhelping out, which is lovely and part
OL,8,Fof our re-build process all together,"
OL,9,Fshe said.
